+///                                    * 0: no valid data
+///                                    * 1: data ready to read
+///                                    ###
+///               %unsigned 1  INT_EN                    0x0
+///                                    ###
+///                                    * ADC interrupt enable
+///                                    * 0: disable
+///                                    * 1: enable
+///                                    ###
+///               %%        30         # Stuffing bits...
